{'symbol': 'MDLZ', 'date': '2021-02-18 10:00:00', 'title': 'MONDELĒZ INTERNATIONAL LAUNCHES SUSTAINABLE FUTURES\xa0TO ADVANCE CLIMATE SOLUTIONS AND SUPPORT SOCIAL ENTREPRENEURS', 'text': "CHICAGO, FEB. 18, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- MONDELĒZ INTERNATIONAL, INC. (NASDAQ: MDLZ) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF SUSTAINABLE FUTURES, AN IMPACT INVESTING PLATFORM TO INCUBATE, FINANCE AND SUPPORT SELF-SUSTAINING VENTURES THAT ADDRESS KEY CHALLENGES IN THE WORLD, INCLUDING CLIMATE CHANGE. PART OF THE COMPANY'S ONGOING EFFORTS TO CREATE A POSITIVE IMPACT ON PEOPLE AND PLANET, THE NEW PLATFORM GIVES MONDELĒZ INTERNATIONAL THE OPPORTUNITY TO PURSUE AND NURTURE INNOVATIVE PROJECTS, TOGETHER WITH LIKE-MINDED INVESTORS, THAT ALIGN WITH ITS SUSTAINABILITY STRATEGY AND HELP DELIVER ON ITS COMMITMENTS."}